texts.REST_DESC:
More battles await you on the road ahead.
Rest by the Campfire to restore %d%% of your Max Health;
or roast a piece of meat to take with you and enjoy before a Boss battle;
or add a log to the fire to Remove 1 card from your Deck.
(Choose only 1 of the 3—once chosen, your visit here ends.)

texts.REST_SACRAMENT_DESC:
A serving of Sacrament, still warm, sits beside the Campfire.
You shared it before sitting down—reaching the Campfire restored 50% of your Max Health (already resolved);
you may still roast a piece of meat to take with you and enjoy before a Boss battle;
or add a log to the fire to Remove 1 card from your Deck.
(Choose only 1 of the remaining 2—once chosen, your visit here ends.)
